---
<section id="anforderungen" class="py-12 md:py-24 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

      <div>
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest bg-simsek-green/10 text-simsek-green border border-simsek-green/20 mb-4">
          Anforderungen
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
          Logopädin in Duisburg <br/><span class="text-simsek-blue">gesucht — Voll- & Teilzeit</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="h-px bg-linear-to-r from-simsek-green via-simsek-blue/40 to-transparent mb-6"></div>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Du musst keine Übermensch sein. Aber du solltest Lust haben, wirklich gute Therapie zu machen – und dabei du selbst zu sein.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-simsek-green/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-simsek-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Staatlich anerkannt und zugelassen</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Ausbildung oder Studium in Logopädie beziehungsweise Sprachtherapie.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-simsek-green/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-simsek-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Sehr gute Deutschkenntnisse</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Weitere Sprachen sind willkommen, aber keine Voraussetzung.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-simsek-green/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-simsek-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Berufsanfänger:innen willkommen</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Berufserfahrung und fertige Spezialisierungen sind nicht erforderlich.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-8 rounded-4xl">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-simsek-green uppercase tracking-wide">Auf einen Blick</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-simsek-green font-bold text-lg">✓</span> Vollzeit (38,5 Std.) oder Teilzeit mit variablem Umfang</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-simsek-green font-bold text-lg">✓</span> Vier-Tage-Woche möglich</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-simsek-green font-bold text-lg">✓</span> 22–26 € brutto pro Stunde plus jährliches Weihnachtsgeld</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-simsek-green font-bold text-lg">✓</span> Eigene fachliche Schwerpunkte</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-simsek-green font-bold text-lg">✓</span> Berufsanfänger:innen willkommen</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-simsek-green font-bold text-lg">✓</span> Tonhallenstraße 21, Duisburg (2 Min. Hbf)</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10">
            <a href="/jobs/logopaedin-sprachtherapeut-duisburg/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-linear-to-r from-simsek-green to-simsek-blue text-white font-bold rounded-full shadow-md shadow-simsek-green/20 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-simsek-green/30 hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-[0.97] transition-all duration-200 no-underline text-sm">
              Stellendetails ansehen
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 text-center">Mehrere unbefristete Stellen · Eintrittstermin nach individueller Vereinbarung</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
